@baseUrl = http://localhost:5106

### Sign in
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"ChangeMe!2026"}

### Copy the returned token here
@token = paste-token-here

### Create a rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/environments/dev/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cidr":"192.0.2.7","kind":"Allow","description":"Demo workstation","owner":"Demo operator"}

### Inspect synchronization evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Evaluate after synchronization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/check?ip=192.0.2.7&env=dev
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Issue a scoped integration key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integration-clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo service","scopes":["ip:check"]}

### Copy the one-time key here
@apiKey = paste-key-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/check?ip=192.0.2.7&env=dev
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Snapshot drift (returns Allow and Block snapshots, each with listKind)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/environments/dev/reconcile?autoFix=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
